        "raw": "Beat, the hip jive turkey who's the funky fresh realness from the streets!\n\nSamba the spicy Latina.\n\nPluck, who can go ***ck himself.\n\nI don't even know how to spell the last one.\n\nThis story being intentionally bad saddens me, because the story of the Virtuosos fighting AB over the centuries has a lot of the same vibe as the Legacy line, but global and millenia of lost history instead of an American family tree.  The four could have grown to become a new window into the past history of these warriors; with AB gone, the Void has a power vacuum and might be a much greater threat.\n\nExtrasode 8: Christopher and Adam Give Fake Pet Care Advice.\n\nHaka isn't undead, he's re-alive.  And AA was never dead, he was simply de-existified.",
